{"title":"Siegemaster Grukh","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Siegemaster Grukh is a trainer — a named <a href=\"#/monster/thak-shieldbearer\">Thak Shieldbearer</a> seen at level 56.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Siegemaster Grukh</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2068, 1027</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"siegemaster-grukh\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">10 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-torso\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/280b7b80b5d81046f763.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-longsword\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c1a26b20d934bb883929.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Thak Shieldbearers</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/shield-captain-vorsk\">Shield-Captain Vorsk</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/4032e328046366254547.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Siegemaster Grukh</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/thak-shieldbearer\">Thak Shieldbearer</a></td></tr><tr><th>Role</th><td>trainer</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>56</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,167</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}